name:           remax
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       Hunk review with tracked verdicts and in-place editing
description:    Hunk-by-hunk code review in the terminal: the whole file on screen,
                hunks decorated in place by a live diff, editing anywhere with
                helix-flavored modal keys, and per-line content-keyed verdicts
                (reviewed / flagged / questioned) that survive rebases.
